WEBVTT

00:00:01.010 --> 00:00:03.340
That's our prey this time.

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:05.260
The Golden Snake of Carmine?

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:07.050
For food?

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:11.100
It's for the carmine berry it's guarding.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:11.690
He noticed us.

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:12.900
Back off.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.070
Rei-san.

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:16.820
You bastard.

00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:22.090
You almost hurt my friends!

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:27.280
No need to get so worked up.
With my Amorphic Bones—

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:28.170
No, you won't.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:31.350
This is a monster with a complete Inner Dan.

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:34.050
That's where the beam came from.

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:38.980
Ki gathering, no, even one at the Foundation Stage couldn't withstand it.

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:44.690
But you're not harmed at all, I guess the rumors
are right, you must be related to the chief.

00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:46.900
Fatty McFatt, watch what you're saying!

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:51.860
Don't worry, it's the truth.
I'm the chief's daughter.

00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:56.110
What's with that face,
saying "what a cheap plot device".

00:00:56.450 --> 00:01:00.120
Then why did you start an inn,
and not go into cultivation?

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:02.120
That's my line.

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:06.620
It all began 30 years ago, when the Reiken
Sect was in the midst of a crisis.

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:09.080
The nine-tailed fox suddenly appeared—

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:10.670
It's opening time!

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:11.960
Just hold that thought.

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:19.420
Let us paint the sky with a rainbow of colors

00:01:41.850 --> 00:01:49.550
We drew a scribbled map of the future with no defined end

00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:56.250
But you smiled saying, "no matter how lost we get,

00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:59.770
or how much we cry, the end will come"

00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:06.930
If tomorrow was an untouched white canvas

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:12.640
I'd like to see what kind of colors would shine the brightest

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:16.990
Like tears leaving behind a rainbow

00:02:17.230 --> 00:02:22.930
I'll prove to you I can change this world

00:02:23.060 --> 00:02:27.260
Let us paint the sky with a rainbow of colors

00:02:27.510 --> 00:02:30.300
Listening to the footsteps of a tomorrow

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:34.480
whose name we've yet to know

00:02:44.360 --> 00:02:49.060
30 years ago, a nine-tail fox had appeared.

00:02:50.130 --> 00:02:53.820
It's a divine monster that dates back to ancient times.

00:02:54.530 --> 00:02:56.650
It was the first time since the Mappo Age,

00:02:56.650 --> 00:03:02.040
that a monster with enough power to change
the face of this planet, had appeared.

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:10.720
When left alone, it has the potential to evolve into
an entity that can rival even a top-level cultivator,

00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:18.950
and bring catastrophe to the Nine Regions.

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:24.960
The Universal Divine Seal is the most powerful
spell written in the Stellar Sword Techniques.

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:29.010
It left a great legacy, after having been used
by ancient cultivators of the Reiken Sect.

00:03:29.010 --> 00:03:34.550
The original version was no longer intact, since portions of the spell were lost over the years.

00:03:35.550 --> 00:03:39.890
However it still remained a powerful spell only a true deity could handle.

00:03:39.890 --> 00:03:42.930
Only being at the stage of Semi-Deity,
the chief was unable to cast it.

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:46.410
But it was the only chance they had
against the nine-tailed fox.

00:03:47.230 --> 00:03:52.930
With the help of two other disciples,
and a buffing spell - Dense Mist,

00:03:52.930 --> 00:03:57.420
they were able to gather ki from throughout
the entire region, to create a vacuum point.

00:03:59.350 --> 00:04:04.320
Which was the result of the combination
of the Formation of Protection from the Reiken Sect,

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:07.430
and the ki gathered from the entire Sokei region.

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:14.640
This would enable the vacuum point to enclose,
and effectively eliminate any divine being.

00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:19.570
As long as it was suppressed by the flow of ki,
and under the Formation of Protection.

00:04:20.930 --> 00:04:25.160
However, the spell also requires a sacrifice.

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:28.060
During the ritual the chief chose a young girl,

00:04:28.060 --> 00:04:38.020
in order to create the vacuum point
that sealed the nine-tailed fox.

00:04:38.020 --> 00:04:41.340
That sacrificial girl, was me.

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:45.370
The nine-tailed fox is still inside me.

00:04:45.370 --> 00:04:51.630
Which is why divine power, like that beam
or any other spell won't work on me.

00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:56.980
It also means that I'm not able to cultivate,
I can only lead the life of a commoner.

00:04:57.380 --> 00:05:02.360
The crisis happened 30 years go,
so you're already an old woman in her thir—

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:06.660
But that's really amazing!

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:11.160
You must be mad at the chief who
made you unable to cultivate.

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:12.240
Nope.

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:15.870
What I don't like is his guilty conscience,
and the attitude that it cultivates.

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:18.720
Rei-chan, shall we sleep together tonight?

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:19.630
Get out.

00:05:20.430 --> 00:05:22.840
Let's get back to picking herbs.

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:24.220
What's that?

00:05:24.740 --> 00:05:27.470
An "urgent summoning" charm.

00:05:28.520 --> 00:05:35.340
The hall at Spirit Lake Peak, is a common place
of social gathering for higher ranks in the Reiken Sect.

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:38.760
It's a place where regular disciples are prohibited.

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:43.990
It's also called the "Pink Hall"
due to its red-colored exterior.

00:05:44.660 --> 00:05:49.330
Doujin novels penned by anonymous author Riku and Mai

00:05:49.330 --> 00:05:55.270
depicting the erotic lives of elders and their female disciples in the Pink Hall

00:05:55.270 --> 00:06:03.880
are extremely popular amongst the disciples.

00:06:04.650 --> 00:06:07.880
<i>Maybe they found out that
I'm the author of those doujin novels?</i>

00:06:11.400 --> 00:06:18.030
Chief, Elder Ryuken, and Elder Hokaku,
I came as soon as I was summoned.

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:22.440
Sorry, but how should I address this person?

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:27.470
Oh right, you've never met.

00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:29.360
He's the 7th Elder of the Heavenly Sword Hall,

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:32.430
the one in charge of the Azure Cloud Peak.

00:06:32.430 --> 00:06:36.600
He just returned after traveling
around for the last 3 years.

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:39.620
He wanted to meet you immediately, thus the summoning.

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:43.590
Is it because of the trouble
I caused at Azure Cloud Peak?

00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:45.910
So you're Oriku?

00:06:45.910 --> 00:06:49.470
The amazing legacy disciple from
2 years ago, with the Void Spirit Base.

00:06:51.320 --> 00:06:55.100
Just like the rumors,
you're almost exactly like Elder Obu.

00:06:55.550 --> 00:06:59.100
How could I be like that dishonorable teacher.

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:02.440
I expected no less from Elder Obu's future successor.

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:04.610
I could sense your potential from
the moment you stepped in.

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:11.210
Here's a gift for you, refined from the thousand-year old
divine grass that I gathered from the outer-regions.

00:07:11.210 --> 00:07:12.620
A Cloud Fusion Pill.

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:16.280
<i>The 2nd tier cloud pill, that Cloud Fusion Pill?!</i>

00:07:16.280 --> 00:07:18.870
<i>Such an expensive item is being given, to me?</i>

00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:25.230
Don't feel shy, any disciple
of Obu is also a disciple of mine.

00:07:25.230 --> 00:07:26.710
Oh right.

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:29.880
These are the items that Obu
asked me to bring back as souvenirs.

00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:39.060
<i>For real? How could someone like her
be acquainted with such a rich person?</i>

00:07:39.430 --> 00:07:45.360
7th elder, we're all familiar with each other,
you can remove your hood.

00:07:45.710 --> 00:07:50.700
Oh yeah, just an old habit from my travels.

00:07:51.090 --> 00:07:52.990
B-Black elder?!

00:07:55.070 --> 00:08:00.720
Well, what can I say, even Obu called me "Blackie".

00:08:00.720 --> 00:08:02.800
You can go ahead and call me that if you'd like.

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:05.760
No way. You're an elder.

00:08:05.760 --> 00:08:09.630
There's basic etiquette we must follow,
no matter how close you may be to your disciple.

00:08:10.570 --> 00:08:12.550
Well, I guess so.

00:08:14.020 --> 00:08:20.650
<i>It's not rare to see people from different races in
the Nine Regions, but it is rare to see a black elder...</i>

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:23.480
<i>I think I can speculate now, </i>

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:27.430
<i>as to why he's such good friends with my teacher.</i>

00:08:27.430 --> 00:08:33.530
<i>It must be because my teacher loved
his body and techniques!</i>

00:08:33.850 --> 00:08:39.720
I haven't introduced myself, never mind
the formalities, my real name is Gokankai.

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:41.410
Gokankai?

00:08:42.130 --> 00:08:45.670
<i>It's not that I don't want to be close to you but...</i>

00:08:46.910 --> 00:08:48.290
Oriku!

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:50.550
We got the carmine berry!

00:08:50.950 --> 00:08:52.560
Seriously?

00:08:52.560 --> 00:08:54.370
What's with that attitude?

00:08:54.370 --> 00:08:57.470
Who's that?

00:09:00.870 --> 00:09:04.510
The 7th Elder, the one in charge of Azure Cloud Peak?!

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:11.190
Don't sweat it, it's just a carmine berry, I don't mind at all.

00:09:11.620 --> 00:09:14.700
Now that you've picked it,
let's not let it go to waste.

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:21.200
I've got the best equipment to help you refine it.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:24.740
It should sell for 10 times more than the original.

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:27.830
What a kind-hearted person.

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:31.840
I'm well acquainted with Obu's techniques,

00:09:32.390 --> 00:09:35.890
I also read the guide she left you.

00:09:35.890 --> 00:09:39.060
Looks like the Amorphic Bones
has evolved even further.

00:09:39.060 --> 00:09:43.600
It's one of the best techniques available to train
one's body for cultivation at the Foundation Stage.

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:49.360
Well too bad my next steps weren't written down.

00:09:50.030 --> 00:09:55.700
It's a good thing that your progress
surpassed what Obu had anticipated.

00:09:55.700 --> 00:09:58.360
I can check it out for you, if you'd like.

00:09:58.710 --> 00:10:00.370
Check it? How?

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:03.370
Of course, by entering your body.

00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:11.420
I should've known! Entering my body?
No thanks, leave that to my teacher.

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:14.000
Are you thinking something inappropriate?

00:10:14.570 --> 00:10:18.380
I mean I'd use Inner Observance,
to see your progress.

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:20.680
Oh, Inner Observance.

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:23.660
Beautiful.

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:27.380
Just as expected from the genius
who Obu picked as legacy disciple.

00:10:27.380 --> 00:10:33.630
The one shining like the sun in the middle,
is the dominant amorphic bone,

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:38.700
under its guidance you'll be able
to gather ki through the other bones.

00:10:39.580 --> 00:10:43.890
You've already completed the first level.

00:10:43.890 --> 00:10:47.960
I know because I can see yellow
fluids formed from the ki gathered.

00:10:48.520 --> 00:10:53.590
The next step is to form a foundation
out of the fluids, right?

00:10:54.030 --> 00:10:56.710
No that won't be for some time.

00:10:56.710 --> 00:11:01.260
For now you'll need to form real bones,
to form Amorphic Swords from these fluids.

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:06.380
Real bones? The ones I have now are fake?

00:11:06.380 --> 00:11:07.890
Not fake but...

00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:11.900
Consider this, what are the properties of a sword?

00:11:12.490 --> 00:11:14.040
Properties?

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:17.820
Sharp, hard, and flexible, which means...

00:11:18.420 --> 00:11:23.380
The bones for Amorphic Swords
need to have those properties as well.

00:11:23.380 --> 00:11:27.910
What you have formed now is only the outer exterior.

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:31.620
There is a lot of work left to be done.

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:33.460
It's nothing but a scabbard for the sword.

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:40.550
I'll give you a pill now, to efficiently
breakthrough to the next stage.

00:11:40.910 --> 00:11:42.970
Come out, Alchemy Furnace!

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:49.600
What a fitting design.

00:11:52.150 --> 00:11:56.240
This is the pill I developed together with Obu.

00:11:56.240 --> 00:12:01.450
Currently at its 23rd version, its effects
have been improved numerous times.

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:06.610
It should help you reach the 5th stage of Sword Bones,

00:12:06.610 --> 00:12:10.080
somewhere right before the Foundation Stage.

00:12:11.320 --> 00:12:13.650
<i>The effects are amazing. </i>

00:12:13.650 --> 00:12:20.340
<i>It's as if all 206 of my bones are
evolving, at the exact same time!</i>

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:26.030
<i>What a sharp force of ki from a sword. </i>

00:12:26.030 --> 00:12:29.010
<i>The direction is, Amorphic Peak?</i>

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:32.350
Why are you helping me so much?

00:12:32.790 --> 00:12:36.110
Because I was asked to.

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:38.070
I take what Obu asks of me very seriously.

00:12:38.760 --> 00:12:42.360
It's the least I can do, to repay
for the help she gave me.

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:44.400
Help?

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:47.870
I was actually a slave from the west.

00:12:48.890 --> 00:12:56.830
I was brought from the other side of the Endless Sea.

00:12:57.690 --> 00:13:01.940
I had no social status in neither
the Nine Regions nor the west.

00:13:01.940 --> 00:13:05.010
However, the Reiken Sect saved me.

00:13:05.770 --> 00:13:10.140
Obu saw the potential in me,
and led me into cultivation.

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:14.810
Putting on the new name Okankai,
I abandoned my former name, Obaba.

00:13:15.530 --> 00:13:22.800
After a hundred years, the others saved
along with me had long ago deceased,

00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:25.620
while I alone stood at the stage of Nascent Soul.

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:27.660
It's all thanks to Obu.

00:13:29.610 --> 00:13:32.240
These two definitely had something goin' on!

00:13:33.590 --> 00:13:38.830
The 5th Elder got into trouble with another big sect.

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:44.050
Aren't you her disciple?

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:48.430
She's now being questioned by the other
elders of Heavenly Sword Hall.

00:13:48.790 --> 00:13:55.540
If she finally learned her lesson, wouldn't
everyone in the Reiken Sect be thankful?

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:58.810
You've misunderstood her.

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:01.340
I met her several times.

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:06.320
She is without a doubt a true swordsman,
possessing a rock hard will and unwavering dignity.

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:09.320
You should have faith in her.

00:14:13.170 --> 00:14:19.140
The 5th elder caused trouble with the people
of the Seikyo Sect, and is now being questioned.

00:14:19.140 --> 00:14:21.670
She might lose her position as an elder,

00:14:22.230 --> 00:14:25.690
she's already at the lowest stage to begin with.

00:14:26.490 --> 00:14:31.310
I heard the 2nd and 3rd elders are
giving her a really hard time now.

00:14:31.310 --> 00:14:34.150
But that just shows how tough she is.

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:39.440
That's only a rumor, she'd has
nothing else to show off.

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:44.240
The Jin-Dan stage can't even stand one
hit from the Nascent Soul stage.

00:14:44.240 --> 00:14:47.150
On top of that considering her personality...

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:48.820
Legacy disciple Oriku!

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:54.630
Long-time no see, are you also here for the show?

00:14:54.630 --> 00:14:57.120
What are you doing here, Oriku?

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:01.170
What, just because my teacher's
in trouble now, so am I?

00:15:01.740 --> 00:15:09.390
I didn't mean that, but do you know with
whom the elders are meeting with right now?

00:15:09.390 --> 00:15:12.020
The secret lover of my teacher?

00:15:12.020 --> 00:15:14.430
Are they thinking I'm Obu's illegitimate child?

00:15:14.880 --> 00:15:17.700
You're just like your teacher.

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:21.190
No, it's people from the Seikyo Sect.

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:23.600
Seikyo Sect?

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:26.400
The leading sect in the Mansen Sect Alliance?

00:15:27.180 --> 00:15:33.910
Must be a big deal, for someone from
the Seikyo Sect to come all the way here.

00:15:34.340 --> 00:15:37.620
Maybe my teacher tried to get-with
some girl from the Seikyo Sect?

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:39.910
Your teacher is a woman too.

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:42.920
Or she slept with the elder's boyfriend?

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:45.250
The main elder of the Seikyo Sect is a man!

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:49.900
Bunin-chan you're so naive,
you know nothing about true love.

00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:52.720
What kind of nonsense are you implying?

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:57.970
How long are you guys going to take
to confirm a few obvious facts?

00:15:58.940 --> 00:16:01.100
Or are you just trying to protect her?

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:06.150
What obvious facts are you talking about?
It's your word against hers.

00:16:06.780 --> 00:16:09.820
I don't want to hear words uttered from an inferior race.

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:16.620
Spreading irresponsible nonsense,
and damaging the reputation of my sect.

00:16:17.090 --> 00:16:20.250
Whether it's nonsense or not
has not yet been decided.

00:16:20.800 --> 00:16:25.460
So in other words, you just want to protect her?

00:16:30.470 --> 00:16:32.630
This is everything that happened?

00:16:33.070 --> 00:16:38.060
It's not everything in full detail,
there are some private things left out.

00:16:38.480 --> 00:16:41.350
But that's mostly how it went.

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:43.730
If what you're saying is true,

00:16:44.680 --> 00:16:50.380
the words on this Truth Paper
are enough to convince us,

00:16:50.380 --> 00:16:54.660
but it holds no weight for people outside the sect.

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:56.990
Guess we'll have to ask Chief to decide.

00:16:58.080 --> 00:16:59.800
Congrats on causing more trouble!

00:16:59.800 --> 00:17:03.520
I'm counting down the days till you're
relieved of your position as an elder.

00:17:03.520 --> 00:17:04.330
I'll kill you.

00:17:04.720 --> 00:17:07.760
So, what really happened?

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:10.080
It was no big deal.

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:14.130
I just left the mountain to refine some materials.

00:17:15.060 --> 00:17:19.690
In the country of White Moon, I came across a new sect
called "Thousand Spirit" that was causing quite a fuss.

00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:25.140
Normally such a small sect wouldn't
even catch my attention,

00:17:25.650 --> 00:17:30.250
if it was not for the fact that its
slogan was, "cultivation for everyone".

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:34.440
That's not uncommon, there are
tons of con-men out there.

00:17:35.290 --> 00:17:37.080
Well they were starting from the capital,

00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:42.870
and trying to spread across the whole country.
These guys were taking the "high end" road.

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:47.640
That's strange, even in a small
country like White Moon,

00:17:47.640 --> 00:17:50.630
someone who knows about cultivation
should be able to see through their farse.

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:58.720
Interestingly enough, this time it's someone who
knows about cultivation, who started the sect.

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:05.980
They made huge profits under
the slogan "cultivation for everyone".

00:18:05.980 --> 00:18:07.770
By the order of the emperor,

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:12.990
and with the governments' help,
a cultivator at the Foundation Stage

00:18:12.990 --> 00:18:16.680
was able to easily reach the Pseudo-Dan stage.

00:18:16.680 --> 00:18:21.470
I thought there must've been a breakthrough in
the technique of the composite spirit base,

00:18:21.470 --> 00:18:22.590
so I did some research.

00:18:22.590 --> 00:18:24.910
But what I found was...

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:27.160
The Essence and Blood Boiling Technique.

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:30.210
The one that uses your own lifespan as resource?

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:31.210
Exactly.

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:33.050
The technique of burning through one's own life.

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:40.300
The Thousand Spirit Sect conned normal people
with composite spirit bases, into cultivation.

00:18:40.670 --> 00:18:45.910
And let them cultivate using
the Essence and Blood Boiling Technique.

00:18:45.910 --> 00:18:52.600
It looked like they were making incredible progress,
but the fact is, they're all running towards their own demise.

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:55.600
Hold on,

00:18:55.600 --> 00:19:01.140
in that case, shouldn't there have been
many deaths in the Thousand Spirit Sect?

00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:03.580
Well that's where they played smart.

00:19:04.340 --> 00:19:10.870
They made some modifications to
the Essence and Blood Boiling Technique.

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:13.960
They made it so it wouldn't
burn through the lifespan as fast.

00:19:14.940 --> 00:19:17.340
At first all you can feel is a bit of exhaustion,

00:19:18.150 --> 00:19:20.220
which is easily removed through some rest.

00:19:21.130 --> 00:19:27.370
The extension of a lifespan that comes with progress
in cultivation supplemented for what had already been taken,

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:29.620
so nothing wrong could be found.

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:33.040
No problem if the technique is balanced.

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:34.700
There is!

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:40.020
How is it cultivation if you're just gonna
use your own lifespan to breakthrough?

00:19:40.020 --> 00:19:46.280
You think cultivation is something that cheap?
Then why do we put so much effort into it?

00:19:46.940 --> 00:19:53.230
The progress they made, and stages that they reached,
are nothing but a sand castle on the beach.

00:19:54.180 --> 00:19:57.170
Only good on the outside, with no real solid interior.

00:19:57.850 --> 00:20:05.140
Yeah, you're right. But I'm still
surprised that you didn't just pass by.

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:12.490
Yeah I know, a bunch of fools getting conned in
White Moon Country, has nothing to do with me at all.

00:20:12.490 --> 00:20:15.320
Then where did all this trouble come from?

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:17.820
There was an unfortunate turn of events somewhere.

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:23.540
I started quarreling with a disciple at
the main base of the Thousand Spirit Sect.

00:20:23.540 --> 00:20:28.320
I tried to solve it with a duel,
since he was also at the Jindan Stage.

00:20:28.320 --> 00:20:32.830
I didn't even use my hands, or feet, or even
my good looks, but I defeated him in an instant!

00:20:33.270 --> 00:20:37.140
Then some high level elder came out,
whom I also easily defeated.

00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:41.010
Then some elder of another sect
at the Nascent Soul Stage came out...

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:44.460
What? What's so funny?

00:20:44.460 --> 00:20:47.530
I just didn't know that you had such a heart for justice.

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:51.790
I don't really have a heart for it.

00:20:51.790 --> 00:20:53.940
I just wanted to laugh at them.

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:56.190
I'll be going now!

00:20:56.660 --> 00:20:58.690
That's really unlike her.

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:00.330
You're mistaken.

00:21:00.330 --> 00:21:01.190
Rei-san.

00:21:01.730 --> 00:21:05.030
Obu might look selfish, but she's your teacher.

00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:08.720
As her disciple, you should know better.

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:13.990
The Amorphic Bones she taught you is the real deal.

00:21:13.990 --> 00:21:18.880
Even at the Kinesthetic Stage,
your defense is already insanely high.

00:21:19.930 --> 00:21:26.660
There were at least 100 disciples during the Golden Age of the Reiken Sect,

00:21:26.660 --> 00:21:29.260
and Obu was one out of the 10 that survived.

00:21:29.260 --> 00:21:33.640
Not only that, but she managed to become
an elder with her own technique.

00:21:34.290 --> 00:21:37.150
And with an Odd Spirit Base,

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:43.610
how much more effort must she have put
into cultivation, to reach her current status?

00:21:43.610 --> 00:21:51.790
She spent all her fortune on medicine,
and lead a stingy life with only one set of clothes.

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:55.710
How is it a stingy life when
she spends it all on alcohol?

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:58.500
That's the divine medicine she uses to cultivate her ki.

00:22:02.290 --> 00:22:05.010
Let's solve this with some brute force.

00:22:18.020 --> 00:22:23.740
The beat that quivers
within my worn down memory,

00:22:24.170 --> 00:22:27.210
Drowns in my slumber,

00:22:27.380 --> 00:22:29.050
sinking below the surface

00:22:29.350 --> 00:22:35.070
My eyes, as they
look up to a pouring sky

00:22:35.460 --> 00:22:40.470
Reflect a heart locked
away by the moonlight

00:22:40.810 --> 00:22:51.320
Only my most twisted pain
lies within this weaving infinity

00:22:51.550 --> 00:22:57.760
Bleeding away miserably
as our intertwined fingers untangle

00:22:58.100 --> 00:23:01.490
Clinging to your feelings,

00:23:01.770 --> 00:23:04.690
oh so powerfully

00:23:05.080 --> 00:23:10.250
I'll show you I can go
beyond this rusted world

00:23:10.780 --> 00:23:15.840
The words that pierced
through this permanent illusion

00:23:16.100 --> 00:23:25.940
Resound through my out stretched fingers

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:37.940
"Reiken Sect vs Seikyo Sect".

00:23:37.940 --> 00:23:39.770
Waiting for you at the Reiken Mountain.
